description":"Overall summary of AEs and SAEs during the Initial treatment period is presented.\nFor list of AEs and SAEs by MedDRA system organ class (SOC) and preferred term (PT) during the entire trial period (including safety follow-up), see Adverse Events Overview section.","populationDescription":"The analysis was performed on the safety analysis set.\nThe safety analysis set comprised of participants who received at least 1 dose of IMP during the trial.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","timeFrame":"Week 0 to Week 16","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Tralokinumab 300 mg Q2W","description":"<p>Week 0 to Week 16:</p><p>Tralokinumab 300 mg Q2W</p><p>At Day 0, each subject received 4 SC injections (each 1.0 mL) of 150 mg tralokinumab to receive a total loading dose of 600 mg tralokinumab (4.0 mL).\nAt subsequent visits (Q2W) each subject received 2 SC injections (each 1.0 mL) of 150 mg tralokinumab to receive a total dose of 300 mg tralokinumab.</p>"},{"id":"OG001","title":"Placebo Q2W","description":"<p>Week 0 to Week 16:</p><p>Placebo Q2W.</p><p>At Day 0, each subject received 4 SC injections (each 1.0 mL) of placebo to receive a total loading dose (4.0 mL).\nAt subsequent visits (Q2W) each subject received 2 SC injections (each 1.0 mL) of placebo.</p>"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"602"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"196"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"AEs","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"411"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"133"}]}]},{"title":"SAEs","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"23"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"8"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Frequency of Anti-drug Antibodies","description":"Anti-tralokinumab antibody levels were analysed using a validated bioanalytical method.","populationDescription":"All subjects in the safety analysis set are included","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"COUNT_OF_